    "scenesThatPass": [
      "BEE: Jesus!\nBERNADETTE: We live a life of privilege, Balakrishna. We can't just switch off the world.",
      "BERNADETTE: Holy --!\nBERNADETTE: I draw the line at re-raping.\nBERNADETTE: Jammed again.\nBEE: Hold on...",
      "BERNADETTE: Bala once again outsmarted a velociraptor.\nBEE: More like a praying mantis.\nBERNADETTE: Flying monkey?",
      "BEE: I don't think what happened was avoidable. But if there's one thing-looking back-I wish I didn't do, it's this:\nBEE: Ahem.\nBEE: Since I have you both here... I have an announcement to make.\nBERNADETTE: Are you engaged?",
      "BERNADETTE: You have to work.\nBEE: Holy shit, that's a yes!\nBERNADETTE: Don't say shit.\nBEE: Fucking A that's a yes!"
    ]
  },
